52,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, the cap is a symptom, not the cause. Resolve the data terms first, or the schedule is just a promise we cannot keep.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’m sorry. The ledger is empty. We can’t promise what we can’t pay.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, don’t be so gloomy! The stopwatch proves waiting is the thief. Fixing connections saves time without spending new money!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
